WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:26.789
Hey youtubers, what’s up!

00:00:26.789 --> 00:00:30.939
This video is going to be a breakdown of this
new trailer but there’s also a shit ton

00:00:30.939 --> 00:00:32.550
of news the CW has released.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.989
The Cast of both shows did a big TCA panel
together and talked about new spinoff shows

00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:40.860
they’re working on, what’s going on with
the characters and a bunch of other stuff.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:44.310
Starting with the Arrow footage.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.120
This is just like the Flash trailer I posted
yesterday.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:50.050
It only covers episode 10 but it sets up the
next mini story arc.

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.710
Oliver is gone so Evil rises in the Glades.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:56.339
Primarily in the form of Vinnie Jones here
who’s playing Brick from the comics.

00:00:56.339 --> 00:01:04.339
On the show he’s going to be more of an
enterprising gang leader like Vertigo at the

00:01:04.339 --> 00:01:05.390
beginning of the season.

00:01:05.390 --> 00:01:06.862
I know everyone is wondering where Vertigo
is.

00:01:06.862 --> 00:01:11.400
He will be back in a future episode as part
of Laurel’s Black Canary arc.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:15.090
I don’t know how that will play out but
Vinnie Jones here is going to be the first

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.820
big villain that the new Team Arrow will have
to defeat.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:29.760
I use the term “New” loosely, it’s really
Team Arrow without Oliver, but 

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:44.400
with the addition of Laurel.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:50.190
We do see Oliver in the trailer, someone is
carry his body to this door.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:54.250
I had a theory that I think I mentioned in
my episode 9 video that Merlyn would be the

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:55.500
one to save him.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.140
You can see Merlyn in the Arrow Cave placing
the sword on the table.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.140
I think that’s the sword from the mountain
top that Ra’s Al Ghul threw in the ground.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:02.150
The one with Oliver’s blood on it.

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:06.580
If Merlyn leaves to come bring the sword back
to Starling, that means someone else is taking

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.700
care of Oliver back here in this place.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.119
I think it’s probably Maseo.

00:02:10.119 --> 00:02:12.270
But I wouldn’t be surprised if Nyssa also
helps him.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.680
I wonder if the sword still has his blood
on it.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:20.600
Like Merlyn gives it to them so they can analyze
his blood and know Merlyn is telling the truth.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:26.670
I also posted a theory video about Merlyn
being a hero of sorts in the back half.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.970
I don’t think he’s going to be a white
knight type of hero but I’d say saving Oliver

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.610
on the mountain top qualifies.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.140
I think a lot of people were confused by what
I said too.

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:42.260
I also said I think Merlyn will be straight
up evil by the end of the season, it’s just

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:46.360
that for the short term, this next mini-arc.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:48.830
He’ll help Team Arrow more than he hurts
them.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:56.650
Ray Palmer also going to be one of the more
obvious heros of the back half of the season

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.410
testing out part of his Atom Suit here.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:02.950
They announced at the TCAs that The CW is
working on an ATOM Spin Off show for his character.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.430
Originally the plan was for him to guest star
on The Flash Season 2.

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:10.319
Because he’s a scientist, he naturally fits
in with that Star Labs crowd.

00:03:10.319 --> 00:03:15.710
But there’s this big shift happening behind
the scenes at the CW.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.330
The network itself.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:20.930
They’re doubling down on their comic book
tv shows.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:23.180
Meaning they’re developing another spinoff
for Arrow, that’s the ATOM show and The

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.720
Flash, that would be Robbie Amell’s Firestorm
character.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:28.360
In addition, there’s a new animated Arrow
show that will be digital only.

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:29.710
It will center on Vixen.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:33.250
Marc Guggenheim, the Showrunner on Arrow will
oversee it.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:38.790
It is connected to Arrow but think of it the
same way you think of the Animated Marvel

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.350
and DC shows.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:43.320
Her superpower will be a little like Animal
Man’s.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:51.800
She’ll be able to take on the abilities
of one animal at a time.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:58.540
Oliver and Barry will appear in it so you
should expect Stephen Amell and Grant Gustin

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:02.840
to do their voices.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:09.770
The reason the CW is pushing for all these
extra new comic books shows on top of what

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:12.030
they’ve already got is because the affiliate
network they have their big contract with

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.610
is rumored to be unhappy with their current
programming.

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:21.599
It’s been suggested that before Arrow and
The Flash, the CW was largely a network that

00:04:21.599 --> 00:04:24.080
catered to a female audience.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.390
And the affiliates felt like that wasn’t
broad enough.

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.669
Meaning they wanted more shows that males
ages 18-34 would watch.

00:04:28.669 --> 00:04:30.110
Which equals more male driven superhero shows.

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:32.210
Which is why the CW is developing an ATOM
show, a Firestorm show.

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.210
And so on.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:36.199
They’ll probably have more news about those
at Comic Con this summer but I’m not expecting

00:04:36.199 --> 00:04:37.199
either of those to debut right away.

00:04:37.199 --> 00:04:40.470
It would be crazy if they had two extra new
shows by the end of this year.

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:45.910
It’s reasonable to expect if they do end
up making both those new spinoff shows, they’d

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:46.960
premiere in 2016.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:58.060
I don’t want to speculate too much because
they only just said, yes we are working on

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:02.960
making new spinoffs.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:20.320
The next big news item is crossovers.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:23.400
Each year they’ll do a new crossover episode.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:31.930
Just like the last one, it will be in the
fall.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:45.419
Before the mid-season finales of both shows.

00:05:45.419 --> 00:06:21.282
And yes, the new Supergirl show 
on CBS will also cross over with Arrow and

00:06:21.282 --> 00:06:22.282
The Flash.

00:06:22.282 --> 00:06:31.410
There’s a rumor that Greg Berlanti has a
clause in his contract that allowed him to

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:32.970
do crossovers.

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:40.850
Which I think is funny.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:57.300
Tom Cavanagh confirmed he is one of the Reverse
Flashes, he didn’t say which one.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.919
But Andrew Kreisberg also confirmed Eddie
Thawne is connected to the Reverse Flash lore

00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:00.919
of the comics.

00:07:00.919 --> 00:07:02.009
Here’s what I think is going on.

00:07:02.009 --> 00:07:03.009
In episode 9.

00:07:03.009 --> 00:07:13.270
I think there are two people here and both
of them are harrison wells.

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:16.350
Two separate versions of Harrison Wells and
they’re working together.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:19.400
Otherwise how would he have gotten his hands
on the device.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:27.901
I still think that Eddie Thawne will become
another version of the Reverse Flash, I just

00:07:27.901 --> 00:07:34.380
think that Eddie Thawne is the first version
of the Reverse Flash and Harrison Wells is

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:35.380
his descendant.

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:45.190
Harrison needs Barry to achieve his potential,
so the real quesiton we need to ask now is

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:46.190
why.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:51.720
What is it that Barry does that shapes the
future in the way that Harrison wants.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:08:01.150
Harrison’s sessions with Gideon make it
clear he’s trying to shape the future in

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:02.860
a particular way.

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:12.150
And yes, Morena Baccarin is the voice of Gideon.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:28.139
She’s the 
voice of the computer.

00:08:28.139 --> 00:08:40.010
She said recently that we’d see more Gideon
this year.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:44.630
Lots of stuff to think about.

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:46.730
Here’s my big question for you guys.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.810
What part of all this news are you most excited
about.

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:52.170
Flash Season 2?

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.170
New Spinoffs?

00:08:53.170 --> 00:09:00.339
I’m totally going to have to hire an assistant
with all these new shows I’m going to be

00:09:00.339 --> 00:09:02.130
making videos for.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:10.260
The next big thing next week in addition to
a new episode of Gotham is a new Avengers

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:11.260
Trailer.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.920
I’ll be posting that Monday Night.

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:14.459
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:09:14.459 --> 00:09:17.360
I’m expecting there to be new footage.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:25.850
While you wait for that, click here to watch
the new Flash Trailer and Click here to learn

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.399
about the next couple of episodes on Arrow.

00:09:28.399 --> 00:09:30.180
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:30.690
High Fives!

